  "interpretation": [
    "The dB numerical distributions overlap centrally; tails, especially VH low-end quantiles, differ. Distribution similarity is not measurement equivalence or proof of water classification compatibility.",
    "RTC Gamma0 and benchmark GRD are processed with different radiometric/geometric chains; event angle, terrain flattening, resampling, filtering and spatial texture cannot be normalized away by a log conversion.",
    "Exact Planetary Computer GRD assets are raw uint16 Level-1 DN in radar geometry without CRS; their DN is not compared with model dB. They require calibration LUT, thermal-noise/border-noise treatment, orbit and terrain geocoding before a defensible comparison."
  ],
